# Media assets (not needed in repo) — images and video, any extension, never
# committed (Tony, 2026-09-04). Case is handled automatically: this repo has
# core.ignorecase=true, so *.png also blocks *.PNG/*.Png/etc. without needing
# to list every case combination (unlike graphify's own ignore file, which
# needs explicit case handling — see .graphifyignore for why).
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4v
*.wmv
*.flv
*.mpg
*.mpeg
*.3gp
